---
/**
 * Architecture at a glance. Built as accessible HTML (real text, no image),
 * theme-aware through tokens, scrolls inside its own container on narrow
 * viewports. Reflects the system described in the case — no infrastructure
 * specifics, no confidential detail.
 */
---

<figure class="arch">
  <div class="arch__scroll scroll-x" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="System architecture diagram">
    <div class="arch__grid">
      <div class="arch__col">
        <p class="arch__coltitle">Clients</p>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Web app</b>
          <span>React · TypeScript — administration, parameterisation, reporting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Mobile app</b>
          <span>React Native · Expo · Zustand · Zod — shop-floor use, sync</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch__link" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>HTTPS / REST</span>
        <span class="arch__link-alt">WebSocket ↑ realtime</span>
      </div>

      <div class="arch__col">
        <p class="arch__coltitle">Application</p>
        <div class="arch__node arch__node--accent">
          <b>REST API</b>
          <span>Spring Boot · Java 21 — domain rules, validation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Auth &amp; access</b>
          <span>JWT (stateless) · profile-based RBAC · login rate limiting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Realtime channel</b>
          <span>Domain events → pushed to connected clients</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Export</b>
          <span>Reports → PDF · CSV · Excel</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arch__link" aria-hidden="true"><span>JDBC</span></div>

      <div class="arch__col">
        <p class="arch__coltitle">Data</p>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>PostgreSQL</b>
          <span>Flyway-managed schema</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Movement events</b>
          <span>Append-only — the record of what happened</span>
        </div>
        <div class="arch__node">
          <b>Read projections</b>
          <span>Indexed views for operational lookups &amp; paginated reports</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="arch__caption">
    Clients talk to one Spring Boot API over REST; a WebSocket channel pushes domain events back so
    the floor and the office converge on the same state. Current position and history are derived
    from an append-only event log in PostgreSQL.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .arch {
    margin-block: var(--space-6);
  }
  .arch__scroll {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: var(--space-5);
  }
  .arch__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .arch__col {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-content: start;
  }

  /* connectors only make sense in the 3-column desktop layout */
  .arch__link {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .arch__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1.15fr auto 1fr;
      align-items: start;
      min-width: 720px;
    }
    .arch__link {
      display: grid;
    }
  }
  .arch__coltitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-steel);
  }
  .arch__node {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-ground);
    padding: 10px 12px;
  }
  .arch__node--accent {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .arch__node b {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .arch__node span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 3px;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .arch__link {
    align-self: center;
    gap: 4px;
    justify-items: center;
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .arch__link::before {
    content: '→';
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .arch__link-alt {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .arch__caption {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-steel);
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
</style>
